# Hallym MIPS v2.4.0 golden no-handler.s: registers and console output at exit.
# Oracle: SPIM 9.1.24 (vendor/spim-9.1.24; its CPU/ is byte-identical to Hallym MIPS v2.4.0's CPU/).
